{"_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": ""}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "The Importance of User Manuals"}, {"type": "position", "content": 10}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 2}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.2"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use when you talk about user manuals."}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Designs a user manual that fulfills both the IT solution needs and the client requirements.  Understand how to write a good user manual."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Discusses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of grammar, vocabulary; level of formality and purpose, and cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to this level.  Exchanges simple information on the operating systems, server operating systems and relevant information related with the user manual."}], "type": "objectives"}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "enpe8n6le02ob10re1img01.jpg"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Look for a manual to use a product you use frequently."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Read the whole manual."}, {"type": "text", "content": "List the characteristics of a good manual you recognize in the manual."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write a short paragraph describing the manual, include your opinion about how useful it is. Don't forget to use the vocabulary and structures learned in this learning material."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Share with a partner."}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I read a manual."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I list characteristics I recognize in the manual."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write a short paragraph describing what I saw."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write my opinion about the usefulness of the manual."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I use the vocabulary and structures learned in this learning material."}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Wish + Past Form of Verb for Wishes"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You can use the verb <span class=\"strong\">wish</span> followed by a verb in <span class=\"strong\">past</span> to talk about things you want."}, {"type": "text", "content": "We can use the verb <span class=\"strong\">wish</span>  to talk about events that we would like to happen in the present. As most of the things we wish for are imaginary, we use verbs in past.  Take a look at the following structure: <br/><br/>   <div class=\"center_text\">Subject + <span class=\"strong\">Wish</span>  +Subject + <span class=\"strong\">Verb in Past</span>  + Complement</div><br/><br/>   Example: <br/> <span class=\"italic\">I <span class=\"strong\">wish</span> I <span class=\"strong\">had</span> a user manual. </span>  <span class=\"italic\">I <span class=\"strong\">wish</span> these instructions <span class=\"strong\">were</span> clearer. </span> <br/> <span class=\"italic\">Paul <span class=\"strong\">wishes</span> he <span class=\"strong\">knew</span> how to assemble the computer. </span><br/><br/>   <span class=\"strong\">Verb to be</span><br/>  As we use wish to talk about imaginary situations, we do not use the past form of the verb be <span class=\"strong\">was</span>; we are going to use <span class=\"strong\">were</span> regardless of the subject. However, in an informal context, you could use <span class=\"strong\">was</span> if you want. <br/><br/>  Example: <br/> <span class=\"italic\">I <span class=\"strong\">wish</span> I <span class=\"strong\">were</span> more skillful with computers. </span><br/> <span class=\"italic\">She <span class=\"strong\">wishes</span> she <span class=\"strong\">were</span> a software engineer. </span>"}, {"type": "example", "content": "I wish I knew more about computers, but I'm not a big fan of electronics."}, {"type": "example", "content": "I wish I could talk to the designers. I would suggest some tips, so users won't feel frustrated. "}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Simple Past Passive- Interrogative Form"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use <span class=\"strong\">simple past passive</span> to provide more importance to the object and the action in a sentence rather than the subject."}, {"type": "text", "content": "When we use <span class=\"strong\">passive voice</span> we focus on the object of the action rather than on the subject. The subject can be mention or omitted and the sentence should keep the same intention. If you want to mention the subject, you use <span class=\"strong\"> <span class=\"italic\">by</span></span> after the verb. To create questions, this is the grammatical structure that you need to follow: <br/>  <br/>  <div class=\"center_text\"><span class=\"strong\">Verb to be in past</span> + Object of the Sentence + <span class=\"strong\">Verb in Past Participle</span> + Complement +?</div><br/><br/>  Example: <br/> <span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">Were</span> those computers <span class=\"strong\">designed</span> to support any kind of file? </span><br/> <span class=\"italic\">Who <span class=\"strong\">were</span> those manuals <span class=\"strong\">written</span> for? </span>"}, {"type": "example", "content": "What were you told by the clerk?"}, {"type": "example", "content": "What else were you instructed to do?"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "clerk"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the person who works in a store"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: What were you told by the clerk?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n6le02ob10aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "exploit"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to make a productive use out of something"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: It teaches them new features and exploits at its maximum all the possibility."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n6le02ob10aud03"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "instruct"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to teach steps or instructions"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: What else were you instructed to do?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n6le02ob10aud04"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "plug"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to connect a cable in a device "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I don't know where to plug in this cable. Can you please check the manual? "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n6le02ob10aud05"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "somehow"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "in a nonspecific way"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adverb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: From the very first time we saw the manual, we started interacting with the product somehow."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n6le02ob10aud06"}], "type": "target_word"}], "type": "sena", "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "welcome", "id": 0, "contents": [{}]}, {"template_override": 1, "contents": [{"value": {"video_src": "enpe8n6le02ob10re2vid01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "", "id": 0, "text": "<strong>Sarah</strong>: I don't know where to plug in this cable. Can you please check the manual? </br>"}, {"time": "4800", "image": "", "id": 1, "text": "<strong>Chris</strong>: Let me see. I wish this user manual was clearer, it doesn't seem to be very user-friendly. </br>"}, {"time": "13800", "image": "", "id": 2, "text": "<strong>Sarah</strong>: I know! I remember the last time I bought a desktop, it wasn't this hard. All the instructions, components, and pictures were very well designed, and we didn't have much trouble putting the parts together. That desktop computer company worked really hard to help users get familiar with their products. </br>"}, {"time": "31000", "image": "", "id": 3, "text": "<strong>Chris</strong>: What were you told by the clerk?  </br>"}, {"time": "33000", "image": "", "id": 4, "text": "<strong>Sarah</strong>: He said I should find everything in the manual. I wish I knew more about computers, but I'm not a big fan of electronics.  </br>"}, {"time": "40000", "image": "", "id": 5, "text": "<strong>Chris</strong>: What else were you instructed to do? </br>"}, {"time": "42000", "image": "", "id": 6, "text": "<strong>Sarah</strong>: He didn't say much, actually. </br>"}, {"time": "44000", "image": "", "id": 7, "text": "<strong>Chris</strong>: I wish I could talk to the designers. I would suggest some tips, so users won't feel frustrated. </br>"}, {"time": "51000", "image": "", "id": 8, "text": "<strong>Sarah</strong>: What else would you suggest? </br>"}, {"time": "52600", "image": "", "id": 9, "text": "<strong>Chris</strong>: I would suggest including better pictures, and color ones if possible. I'd like to have clearer instructions. The ones in here are ignoring important steps and assuming we know how to do everything.  </br>"}, {"time": "64800", "image": "", "id": 10, "text": "<strong>Sarah</strong>: I know, and the size of the manual doesn't feel right. Plus, the font size it uses is too small; there are words I can't even read. </br>"}, {"time": "75400", "image": "", "id": 11, "text": "<strong>Chris</strong>: It's a shame they don't see how important manuals are. We haven't started using this computer yet, and we are already having problems with it.  </br>"}, {"time": "84500", "image": "", "id": 12, "text": "<strong>Sarah</strong>: I agree. From the very first time we saw the manual, we started interacting with the product somehow. A good user manual provides the customers with better experiences with the product. It teaches them new features and exploits at its maximum all the possibility."}]}, "type": "video"}], "type": "video", "_data": [], "id": 4, "title": ""}], "exercises": [{"stimuli_ids": [0], "template_override": 1, "questions": [], "type": "WLC", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "I can talk about past experiences with user manuals."}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "I can describe how to improve a user manual."}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "I can talk about the importance of having good user manuals."}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": "When you buy a product, do you read the documents that come with it inside the box? Why? Why not?"}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": "If you had to write a guide for someone to learn how to use something, what steps would you include?"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Welcome"}], "type": "group"}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "You have 2 tries"}, {"type": "text", "content": "you have 1 attempt left"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "try again"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time"}], "allowed_attempts": 2}}, {"type": "free_header_text", "content": "Ask your partner:"}, {"type": "free_type_text_area", "content": "The Importance of a Document with Detailed Information "}], "img_path": "", "id": 0}, {"stimuli_ids": [4], "template_override": 1, "questions": [{"_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "type": "question"}], "responses": [{"correct": 0, "selected": 0, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "id": 0}, {"correct": 1, "selected": 0, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "id": 1}], "id": 0}], "type": "STI", "_data